## File and export conventions

- **Pages:** Under `resources/js/Pages/` with section subfolders (e.g. `Admin/Rooms/`, `Applications/`). Use `Index.svelte`, `Show.svelte`, `Edit.svelte`, `Create.svelte` where applicable.
- **UI components:** Shared components in `resources/js/Components/ui/`. Use `index.js` re-export (e.g. `Badge`, `badgeVariants`) for public API.

